OL,3,GNEWSAIce rink not returning to town at
OL,4,AChristmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn ice rink will not be returning to a
OL,7,Ftown as part of its festive activities
OL,8,Fafter it made its inaugural appearance
OL,9,Flast winter, a council has confirmed.
OL,11,FWest Northamptonshire Council said
OL,12,Fafter listening to "feedback" it had
OL,13,Ftaken a "different approach" away from
OL,14,Fthe attraction in Northampton.
OL,16,FThe authority said the ice rink
OL,17,Fgenerated #123,500 through ticket and
OL,18,Fbar sales and it "broke even" on costs
OL,19,Flast year.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
